      "source": [
        "---\n",
        "title: \"J1 · Points. Les maternités\"\n",
        "description: \"Les maternités en France entre 2000 et 2024\"\n",
        "image: vignettes/01-points.webp\n",
        "execute:\n",
        "  echo: true\n",
        "code-overflow: wrap\n",
        "number-sections: true\n",
        "resources:\n",
        "  - docs/*.pdf\n",
        "charte:\n",
        "  couleur: \"#009099\"\n",
        "  sombre: \"#3fc1c9\"\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "Comme tout commence par la naissance 👶, pour la première journée du [*30 day map challenge*](https://30daymapchallenge.com/) sur le thème [**\"Points\"**]{.underline color=\"#0A5927\"}, on va représenter la localisation des [maternités françaises en 2024]{.underline} et [celles qui ont fermé depuis 2000]{.underline color=\"#ce614a\"} à partir des données du [SSM Santé (Drees)]{.underline color=\"#0A5927\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "-------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.content-visible when-format=\"html\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "```{ojs}\n",
        "//| echo: false\n",
        "premiere = controle[0]\n",
        "derniere = controle.at(-1)\n",
        "html`<p class=\"lead\">\n",
        "  En ${premiere.annee}, la France comptait <span class=\"souligne\">${premiere.drees} maternités</span>.\n",
        "  Fin ${derniere.annee}, il en reste <span class=\"souligne\">${derniere.drees}</span>,\n",
        "  soit <span class=\"souligne\" style=\"--souligne: #ce614a\">${premiere.drees - derniere.drees} de moins</span>.\n",
        "  <span class=\"souligne\" style=\"--souligne: #ce614a\">${pertes.length} communes</span> ont perdu la leur.\n",
        "  Lancez la lecture pour voir les fermetures année après année.\n",
        "</p>`\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "```{ojs}\n",
        "//| echo: false\n",
        "// Curseur avec lecture automatique. Pas de données entre 2001 et 2007 :\n",
        "// on passe de 2000 à 2008.\n",
        "viewof indice = {\n",
        "  const dernier = annees.length - 1\n",
        "  const form = html`<form class=\"lecteur\">\n",
        "    <button type=\"button\" name=\"lire\">▶ Lire</button>\n",
        "    <input type=\"range\" name=\"curseur\" min=\"0\" max=\"${dernier}\" step=\"1\" value=\"${dernier}\">\n",
        "    <output name=\"annee\"></output>\n",
        "  </form>`\n",
        "  let minuteur = null\n",
        "  const choisir = (i) => {\n",
        "    form.value = i\n",
        "    form.curseur.valueAsNumber = i\n",
        "    form.annee.value = annees[i]\n",
        "    form.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent(\"input\", {bubbles: true}))\n",
        "  }\n",
        "  const arreter = () => {\n",
        "    clearInterval(minuteur)\n",
        "    minuteur = null\n",
        "    form.lire.textContent = \"▶ Lire\"\n",
        "  }\n",
        "  form.lire.onclick = () => {\n",
        "    if (minuteur) return arreter()\n",
        "    if (form.value === dernier) choisir(0)\n",
        "    form.lire.textContent = \"⏸ Pause\"\n",
        "    minuteur = setInterval(() => (form.value < dernier ? choisir(form.value + 1) : arreter()), 1000)\n",
        "  }\n",
        "  form.curseur.oninput = (event) => {\n",
        "    event.stopPropagation()\n",
        "    arreter()\n",
        "    choisir(form.curseur.valueAsNumber)\n",
        "  }\n",
        "  form.onsubmit = (event) => event.preventDefault()\n",
        "  invalidation.then(arreter)\n",
        "  form.value = dernier\n",
        "  form.annee.value = annees[dernier]\n",
        "  return form\n",
        "}\n",
        "anneeData = annees[indice]\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "```{ojs}\n",
        "//| echo: false\n",
        "ouvertes = points.filter((d) => d.annee === anneeData)\n",
        "perdues = pertes.filter((d) => d.derniere < anneeData)\n",
        "// Les trois couleurs des barres du logo de la Drees.\n",
        "couleurOuverte = \"#009099\"\n",
        "couleurPerdue = \"#ce614a\"\n",
        "couleurAnnee = \"#3558a2\"\n",
        "// Pour le texte et la courbe, une teinte plus claire sur fond sombre.\n",
        "texteOuverte = sombre ? \"#3fc1c9\" : couleurOuverte\n",
        "texteCouleurPerdue = sombre ? \"#ec8a74\" : couleurPerdue\n",
        "texteAnnee = sombre ? \"#8ea8e6\" : couleurAnnee\n",
        "\n",
        "html`<p style=\"font-size: 1.1em\">\n",
        "  <strong style=\"color:${texteAnnee}\">${anneeData}</strong> :\n",
        "  <span style=\"color:${texteOuverte}\">● ${ouvertes.length} maternités</span>\n",
        "  &nbsp;·&nbsp;\n",
        "  <span style=\"color:${texteCouleurPerdue}\">✕ ${perdues.length} communes\n",
        "  ont perdu leur maternité depuis 2000</span>\n",
        "</p>`\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "```{ojs}\n",
        "//| echo: false\n",
        "maplibregl = {\n",
        "  const lien = document.createElement(\"link\")\n",
        "  lien.rel = \"stylesheet\"\n",
        "  lien.href = \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/maplibre-gl@4.7.1/dist/maplibre-gl.css\"\n",
        "  document.head.appendChild(lien)\n",
        "  return require(\"maplibre-gl@4.7.1\")\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "territoires = [\n",
        "  [\"Métropole\", [[-5.3, 41.3], [9.7, 51.1]]],\n",
        "  [\"Guadeloupe\", [[-61.85, 15.8], [-61.0, 16.55]]],\n",
        "  [\"Martinique\", [[-61.25, 14.38], [-60.8, 14.9]]],\n",
        "  [\"Guyane\", [[-54.6, 2.1], [-51.6, 5.8]]],\n",
        "  [\"La Réunion\", [[55.2, -21.4], [55.85, -20.85]]],\n",
        "  [\"Mayotte\", [[44.95, -13.05], [45.35, -12.6]]],\n",
        "  [\"Saint-Martin\", [[-63.17, 18.0], [-62.95, 18.13]]]\n",
        "]\n",
        "\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "```{ojs}\n",
        "//| echo: false\n",
        "viewof territoire = Inputs.radio(new Map(territoires), {value: territoires[0][1]})\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "```{ojs}\n",
        "//| echo: false\n",
        "// Interrupteur à deux positions, d'après https://observablehq.com/@linogaliana/sliding-radio-button\n",
        "function bascule({libelles, valeurs, valeur = valeurs[0]}) {\n",
        "  const noeud = html`<div class=\"bascule\">\n",
        "    <span class=\"choix\">${libelles[0]}</span>\n",
        "    <label class=\"glissiere\">\n",
        "      <input type=\"checkbox\" aria-label=\"${libelles[0]} ou ${libelles[1]}\">\n",
        "      <span></span>\n",
        "    </label>\n",
        "    <span class=\"choix\">${libelles[1]}</span>\n",
        "  </div>`\n",
        "  const caseACocher = noeud.querySelector(\"input\")\n",
        "  const [gauche, droite] = noeud.querySelectorAll(\".choix\")\n",
        "  const afficher = () => {\n",
        "    gauche.classList.toggle(\"actif\", !caseACocher.checked)\n",
        "    droite.classList.toggle(\"actif\", caseACocher.checked)\n",
        "  }\n",
        "  const choisir = (cochee) => {\n",
        "    caseACocher.checked = cochee\n",
        "    afficher()\n",
        "    noeud.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent(\"input\", {bubbles: true}))\n",
        "  }\n",
        "  caseACocher.onchange = () => choisir(caseACocher.checked)\n",
        "  gauche.onclick = () => choisir(false)\n",
        "  droite.onclick = () => choisir(true)\n",
        "  Object.defineProperty(noeud, \"value\", {\n",
        "    get: () => valeurs[caseACocher.checked ? 1 : 0],\n",
        "    set: (v) => {\n",
        "      caseACocher.checked = v === valeurs[1]\n",
        "      afficher()\n",
        "    }\n",
        "  })\n",
        "  noeud.value = valeur\n",
        "  return noeud\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "viewof fond = bascule({libelles: [\"Plan IGN\", \"Sans fond\"], valeurs: [\"plan\", \"sans\"]})\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "```{ojs}\n",
        "//| echo: false\n",
        "conteneur = html`<div style=\"height: min(75vh, 680px); border-radius: 4px\"></div>`\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "<small>Source : DREES, [liste des maternités de France depuis 2000](https://data.drees.solidarites-sante.gouv.fr/explore/dataset/fichier_maternites_112021/) (statistique annuelle des établissements de santé) ; ministère de la Santé et ANS, FINESS ; IGN, ADMIN EXPRESS et Géoplateforme. Fond de carte : Plan IGN.</small>\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.content-visible when-format=\"html\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "```{ojs}\n",
        "//| echo: false\n",
        "// Légende repliée. Rayons des cercles : ceux de la carte vue en entier\n",
        "// (zoom 5 environ), qui grossissent quand on zoome.\n",
        "legende = {\n",
        "  const etalons = [500, 2000, 5000]\n",
        "  const rayon = (n) => 0.17 * Math.sqrt(n)\n",
        "  const largeur = 200\n",
        "  const hauteur = 2 * rayon(5000) + 6\n",
        "  let x = 4\n",
        "  const cercles = etalons.map((n) => {\n",
        "    const r = rayon(n)\n",
        "    const cx = x + r\n",
        "    x += 2 * r + 30\n",
        "    return `<circle cx=\"${cx}\" cy=\"${hauteur - r - 3}\" r=\"${r}\" fill=\"${couleurOuverte}\"\n",
        "      fill-opacity=\"0.65\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/>\n",
        "      <text x=\"${cx}\" y=\"${hauteur + 12}\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\"\n",
        "      fill=\"currentColor\">${n.toLocaleString(\"fr-FR\")}</text>`\n",
        "  })\n",
        "  return html`<details class=\"legende\">\n",
        "    <summary>Légende</summary>\n",
        "    <div class=\"legende-contenu\">\n",
        "      <div>\n",
        "        <svg width=\"${largeur}\" height=\"${hauteur + 16}\">${cercles.join(\"\")}</svg>\n",
        "        <div>UMaternité ouverte: surface proportionnelle au nombre d'accouchements</div>\n",
        "      </div>\n",
        "      <div>\n",
        "        <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\">\n",
        "          <path d=\"M3 3L13 13M13 3L3 13\" stroke=\"${couleurPerdue}\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n",
        "        </svg>\n",
        "        <div>Maternité fermée</div>\n",
        "      </div>\n",
        "    </div>\n",
        "    <p><small>Survolez un symbole pour le détail. Les boutons au-dessus de la carte mènent\n",
        "    en outre-mer ; ▶ Lire fait défiler les années.</small></p>\n",
        "  </details>`\n",
        "}\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "```{ojs}\n",
        "//| echo: false\n",
        "// Thème du site (clair/sombre), suivi quand l'utilisateur le change.\n",
        "sombre = Generators.observe((notifier) => {\n",
        "  const lire = () => notifier(document.body.classList.contains(\"quarto-dark\"))\n",
        "  lire()\n",
        "  const observateur = new MutationObserver(lire)\n",
        "  observateur.observe(document.body, {attributes: true, attributeFilter: [\"class\"]})\n",
        "  return () => observateur.disconnect()\n",
        "})\n",
        "\n",
        "// Le Plan IGN n'a pas de style sombre : on inverse la luminosité du style gris.\n",
        "styleClair = fetch(\n",
        "  \"https://data.geopf.fr/annexes/ressources/vectorTiles/styles/PLAN.IGN/gris.json\"\n",
        ").then((r) => r.json())\n",
        "\n",
        "styleSombre = {\n",
        "  const inverser = (v) => {\n",
        "    if (typeof v === \"string\") {\n",
        "      const couleur = d3.color(v)\n",
        "      if (!couleur) return v\n",
        "      const hsl = d3.hsl(couleur)\n",
        "      hsl.l = 0.1 + 0.75 * (1 - hsl.l)\n",
        "      return hsl.formatRgb()\n",
        "    }\n",
        "    if (Array.isArray(v)) return v.map(inverser)\n",
        "    if (v && typeof v === \"object\") {\n",
        "      return Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(v).map(([k, x]) => [k, inverser(x)]))\n",
        "    }\n",
        "    return v\n",
        "  }\n",
        "  const style = structuredClone(styleClair)\n",
        "  for (const couche of style.layers) if (couche.paint) couche.paint = inverser(couche.paint)\n",
        "  return style\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "// Sans fond : du Plan IGN, on ne garde que les terres, la mer et les frontières.\n",
        "function styleSansFond(sombre) {\n",
        "  const terre = sombre ? \"#3a3a3a\" : \"#ececec\"\n",
        "  const eau = sombre ? \"#222\" : \"white\"\n",
        "  const peintures = {\n",
        "    \"bckgrd\": {\"fill-color\": terre},\n",
        "    \"hydro surfacique\": {\"fill-color\": eau, \"fill-outline-color\": eau},\n",
        "    \"limite etat 1\": {\"line-color\": sombre ? \"#555\" : \"#d0d0d0\", \"line-width\": 0.8}\n",
        "  }\n",
        "  return {\n",
        "    ...styleClair,\n",
        "    layers: styleClair.layers\n",
        "      .filter((couche) => couche.id in peintures)\n",
        "      .map((couche) => ({...couche, paint: peintures[couche.id]}))\n",
        "  }\n",
        "}\n",
        "sansFondClair = styleSansFond(false)\n",
        "sansFondSombre = styleSansFond(true)\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "```{ojs}\n",
        "//| echo: false\n",
        "// La carte n'est créée qu'une fois ; les années changent ses données.\n",
        "carte = {\n",
        "  const map = new maplibregl.Map({\n",
        "    container: conteneur,\n",
        "    style: document.body.classList.contains(\"quarto-dark\") ? styleSombre : styleClair,\n",
        "    bounds: territoires[0][1],\n",
        "    attributionControl: {customAttribution: \"DREES, FINESS, IGN\"}\n",
        "  })\n",
        "  invalidation.then(() => map.remove())\n",
        "  map.addControl(new maplibregl.NavigationControl({showCompass: false}))\n",
        "  // Nos couches, à rajouter à chaque changement de style (thème clair/sombre, fond).\n",
        "  const vide = {type: \"FeatureCollection\", features: []}\n",
        "  map.donnees = {ouvertes: vide, perdues: vide}\n",
        "  const ajouterCouches = () => {\n",
        "    const taille = 16\n",
        "    const croix = document.createElement(\"canvas\")\n",
        "    croix.width = croix.height = taille\n",
        "    const ctx = croix.getContext(\"2d\")\n",
        "    ctx.strokeStyle = couleurPerdue\n",
        "    ctx.lineWidth = 2.5\n",
        "    ctx.beginPath()\n",
        "    ctx.moveTo(3, 3); ctx.lineTo(taille - 3, taille - 3)\n",
        "    ctx.moveTo(taille - 3, 3); ctx.lineTo(3, taille - 3)\n",
        "    ctx.stroke()\n",
        "    map.addImage(\"croix\", ctx.getImageData(0, 0, taille, taille), {pixelRatio: 2})\n",
        "\n",
        "    map.addSource(\"perdues\", {type: \"geojson\", data: map.donnees.perdues})\n",
        "    map.addSource(\"ouvertes\", {type: \"geojson\", data: map.donnees.ouvertes})\n",
        "    map.addLayer({\n",
        "      id: \"perdues\", type: \"symbol\", source: \"perdues\",\n",
        "      layout: {\"icon-image\": \"croix\", \"icon-allow-overlap\": true, \"icon-size\": [\n",
        "        \"interpolate\", [\"linear\"], [\"zoom\"], 4, 0.8, 10, 1.6\n",
        "      ]}\n",
        "    })\n",
        "    const racine = [\"sqrt\", [\"coalesce\", [\"get\", \"accouchements\"], 0]]\n",
        "    map.addLayer({\n",
        "      id: \"ouvertes\", type: \"circle\", source: \"ouvertes\",\n",
        "      paint: {\n",
        "        \"circle-color\": couleurOuverte,\n",
        "        \"circle-opacity\": 0.65,\n",
        "        \"circle-stroke-color\": \"white\",\n",
        "        \"circle-stroke-width\": 0.6,\n",
        "        \"circle-radius\": [\n",
        "          \"interpolate\", [\"linear\"], [\"zoom\"],\n",
        "          4, [\"max\", 1.5, [\"*\", 0.11, racine]],\n",
        "          10, [\"max\", 4, [\"*\", 0.45, racine]]\n",
        "        ]\n",
        "      }\n",
        "    })\n",
        "  }\n",
        "  map.on(\"style.load\", ajouterCouches)\n",
        "  await new Promise((resolve) => map.on(\"load\", resolve))\n",
        "  map.resize()\n",
        "\n",
        "  const bulle = new maplibregl.Popup({closeButton: false, closeOnClick: false, maxWidth: \"280px\"})\n",
        "  const decrire = {\n",
        "    ouvertes: (p) => `<strong>${p.nom}</strong><br>${p.nom_commune}<br>\n",
        "      Type ${p.type} · ${p.statut.toLowerCase()}<br>\n",
        "      ${p.accouchements ?? \"?\"} accouchements en ${p.annee}<br>\n",
        "      <small>Localisation : ${p.source}</small>`,\n",
        "    perdues: (p) => `<strong>${p.nom_commune}</strong><br>\n",
        "      Dernière maternité en ${p.derniere}`\n",
        "  }\n",
        "  for (const couche of [\"ouvertes\", \"perdues\"]) {\n",
        "    map.on(\"mousemove\", couche, (e) => {\n",
        "      map.getCanvas().style.cursor = \"pointer\"\n",
        "      bulle.setLngLat(e.lngLat).setHTML(decrire[couche](e.features[0].properties)).addTo(map)\n",
        "    })\n",
        "    map.on(\"mouseleave\", couche, () => {\n",
        "      map.getCanvas().style.cursor = \"\"\n",
        "      bulle.remove()\n",
        "    })\n",
        "  }\n",
        "  return map\n",
        "}\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "```{ojs}\n",
        "//| echo: false\n",
        "function enGeoJSON(lignes) {\n",
        "  return {\n",
        "    type: \"FeatureCollection\",\n",
        "    features: lignes.map((d) => ({\n",
        "      type: \"Feature\",\n",
        "      properties: d,\n",
        "      geometry: {type: \"Point\", coordinates: [d.lon, d.lat]}\n",
        "    }))\n",
        "  }\n",
        "}\n",
        "// Cellules nommées : Quarto n'affiche pas leur valeur.\n",
        "miseAJour = {\n",
        "  carte.donnees = {ouvertes: enGeoJSON(ouvertes), perdues: enGeoJSON(perdues)}\n",
        "  carte.getSource(\"ouvertes\")?.setData(carte.donnees.ouvertes)\n",
        "  carte.getSource(\"perdues\")?.setData(carte.donnees.perdues)\n",
        "  return anneeData\n",
        "}\n",
        "theme = {\n",
        "  const style = fond === \"plan\"\n",
        "    ? (sombre ? styleSombre : styleClair)\n",
        "    : (sombre ? sansFondSombre : sansFondClair)\n",
        "  if (carte.styleCourant !== undefined && carte.styleCourant !== style) {\n",
        "    carte.setStyle(style, {diff: false})\n",
        "  }\n",
        "  carte.styleCourant = style\n",
        "  return sombre\n",
        "}\n",
        "cadrage = carte.fitBounds(territoire, {padding: 20})\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "```{ojs}\n",
        "//| echo: false\n",
        "// Pas de données entre 2001 et 2007 : ce segment est en pointillés.\n",
        "{\n",
        "  const fond = sombre ? \"#222\" : \"white\"\n",
        "  const choisie = controle.filter((d) => d.annee === anneeData)\n",
        "  const ancre = anneeData === annees[0] ? \"start\" : anneeData === annees.at(-1) ? \"end\" : \"middle\"\n",
        "  return Plot.plot({\n",
        "    height: 240,\n",
        "    marginLeft: 44,\n",
        "    marginTop: 30,\n",
        "    x: {label: null, tickFormat: \"d\", ticks: [2000, 2004, 2008, 2012, 2016, 2020, 2024]},\n",
        "    y: {label: \"↑ Maternités\", grid: true, zero: true, ticks: 4, tickFormat: (n) => n.toLocaleString(\"fr-FR\")},\n",
        "    marks: [\n",
        "      Plot.areaY(controle, {x: \"annee\", y: \"carte\", fill: texteOuverte, fillOpacity: sombre ? 0.2 : 0.12}),\n",
        "      Plot.lineY(controle.slice(0, 2), {x: \"annee\", y: \"carte\", stroke: texteOuverte,\n",
        "        strokeWidth: 2, strokeDasharray: \"4,4\"}),\n",
        "      Plot.lineY(controle.slice(1), {x: \"annee\", y: \"carte\", stroke: texteOuverte, strokeWidth: 2.5}),\n",
        "      Plot.ruleX([anneeData], {stroke: texteAnnee, strokeWidth: 1.5, strokeDasharray: \"2,3\"}),\n",
        "      Plot.dot(controle, {x: \"annee\", y: \"carte\", r: 2.5, fill: fond, stroke: texteOuverte, strokeWidth: 1.5}),\n",
        "      Plot.dot(choisie, {x: \"annee\", y: \"carte\", r: 6, fill: texteAnnee, stroke: fond, strokeWidth: 2}),\n",
        "      Plot.text(choisie, {\n",
        "        x: \"annee\", y: \"carte\", dy: -16, textAnchor: ancre,\n",
        "        text: (d) => `${d.carte} maternités en ${d.annee}`,\n",
        "        fill: texteAnnee, fontWeight: \"bold\", fontSize: 12, stroke: fond, strokeWidth: 4\n",
        "      })\n",
        "    ]\n",
        "  })\n",
        "}\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "Cette carte (making of 👇) illustre l'évolution, depuis 2000, de la politique d'aménagement du territoire appliquée au domaine sanitaire. Le sujet des fermetures de maternité est régulièrement discuté dans les médias, par exemple [sur Radio France](https://www.radiofrance.fr/franceinter/podcasts/affaires-sensibles/affaires-sensibles-du-mardi-04-mars-2025-7447211).\n",
        "\n",
        "**On s'appuie pour le J1 sur les [données de la [Drees](https://drees.solidarites-sante.gouv.fr/)]{.underline}**, le service statistique du ministère de la Santé (voir @tip-pour-aller-plus-loin pour quelques publications sur ce sujet).\n",
        "\n",
        "<details>\n",
        "<summary>\n",
        "Lire la dernière fiche sur les maternités dans la panorama des établissements de santé en 2024 de la Drees\n",
        "</summary>\n",
        "\n",
        "```{=html}\n",
        "<embed title=\"Fiche n°19, les établissements de santé en 2024\" src=\"docs/ES2026%20-%20Fiche%2019%20-%20Les%20maternit%C3%A9s_0.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\" width=\"100%\" height=\"480\" />\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "</details>\n",
        "\n",
        "# Making of\n",
        "\n",
        "## Les données\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "La carte croise quatre sources publiques :\n",
        "\n",
        "| Source | Producteur | Ce qu'on en tire | Format |\n",
        "|---|---|---|---|\n",
        "| [Liste des maternités depuis 2000](https://data.drees.solidarites-sante.gouv.fr/explore/dataset/fichier_maternites_112021/) | DREES | les maternités de chaque année, avec leur type, leur statut, leur adresse et leurs accouchements | Excel, une feuille par année |\n",
        "| [FINESS géolocalisé](https://www.data.gouv.fr/fr/datasets/finess-extraction-du-fichier-des-etablissements/) et [FINESS - Structures](https://www.data.gouv.fr/fr/datasets/finess-structures-1/) | Ministère de la Santé, Agence du numérique en santé | la position de chaque établissement, ouvert ou fermé | CSV, JSON |\n",
